 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20full=20standalone/air-gap=20mode?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- C++ Bridge IPC (aegis_ipc.cpp/hpp, packet_parser, bridge_main, bridge_test)
- Rust FFI bindings (aegis_bridge_ffi.rs)
- Zig bindings (aegis_bindings.zig)
- Python ctypes bridge (aegis_bridge_ctypes.py)
- CMakeLists.txt for C++ bridge build
- Windows kernel drivers (minifilter C+C++, WFP callout C+C++)
- egui dashboard (Rust) — bridge_ffi, db, main, rules
- Updated: lib.rs, build.zig, nids_analyze.zig, windows_brain.py,
  windows_perf.go, windows_sec_monitor.rs, aegis_daemon.py
- New: minifilter_reader.zig, pipe_monitor.zig, build_drivers.bat,
  install_drivers.bat, test_e2e.py

Patch applied via custom script (apply_aegis_patch.py) to handle:
  - 'already exists in working directory' errors
  - 'patch does not apply' context mismatches
  - trailing whitespace warnings
